      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1578,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795491565091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TVar y\natomically",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "g17p12gfsg",
      "originalText": "TVar y\natomically",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "g17v91us0a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5398,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1580,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1581,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795491565091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Las variables compartidas pasan a ser TVar (transaccionales, parecidas a un IORef) y sus operaciones\ndevuelven STM a en vez de IO a. STM es una acción MÁS RESTRINGIDA que IO: adentro solo se leen y\nescriben TVars. ATOMICALLY convierte una transacción STM en una acción IO ejecutable y marca su\nFRONTERA: todo lo de adentro se ve como UNA operación. Dos atomically separados permiten que otro\nthread vea el estado entre medio.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Las variables compartidas pasan a ser TVar (transaccionales, parecidas a un IORef) y sus operaciones\ndevuelven STM a en vez de IO a. STM es una acción MÁS RESTRINGIDA que IO: adentro solo se leen y\nescriben TVars. ATOMICALLY convierte una transacción STM en una acción IO ejecutable y marca su\nFRONTERA: todo lo de adentro se ve como UNA operación. Dos atomically separados permiten que otro\nthread vea el estado entre medio.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "g17yzh6vjl",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5538,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1583,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795491565091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "g181xe1xc7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 5553,
      "width": 336,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1586,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1587,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795491565091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "readTVar   :: TVar a -> STM a\nwriteTVar  :: TVar a -> a -> STM ()\natomically :: STM a -> IO a\n\ntype Counter = TVar Int\nincTVar :: Counter -> STM ()\nincTVar counter = do\n    val <- readTVar counter\n    writeTVar counter (val + 1)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "readTVar   :: TVar a -> STM a\nwriteTVar  :: TVar a -> a -> STM ()\natomically :: STM a -> IO a\n\ntype Counter = TVar Int\nincTVar :: Counter -> STM ()\nincTVar counter = do\n    val <- readTVar counter\n    writeTVar counter (val + 1)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
