    {
      "id": "g1ejthfu2z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 7583,
      "width": 451.2,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1820,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1821,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795491565091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "type Semaphore = TVar Bool\n\np sem = do                  -- tomar\n  libre <- readTVar sem\n  if libre then writeTVar sem False\n           else retry       -- ocupado: esperar\n\nv sem = writeTVar sem True  -- liberar",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "type Semaphore = TVar Bool\n\np sem = do                  -- tomar\n  libre <- readTVar sem\n  if libre then writeTVar sem False\n           else retry       -- ocupado: esperar\n\nv sem = writeTVar sem True  -- liberar",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "g1emv37h57",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7783,
      "width": 1097.6000000000001,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1823,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1824,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795491565091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Un recurso con n unidades se toma con check (pedido <= n) y se libera sumándolas de vuelta.\n• ORELSE combina dos transacciones: si la primera hace retry, en vez de esperar PRUEBA LA SEGUNDA.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Un recurso con n unidades se toma con check (pedido <= n) y se libera sumándolas de vuelta.\n• ORELSE combina dos transacciones: si la primera hace retry, en vez de esperar PRUEBA LA SEGUNDA.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
